  entries:
  - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c98c7fa4c88a52f47b0d6556e94a5c3d, type: 2}
    price: 60
    description: "Th\u1EA3m \u0111\u1EC3 g\xE0 h\xEDt \u0111\u1EA5t. Mua r\u1ED3i
      ch\u1ECDn tr\xEAn thanh nhanh, \u0111\u1EE9ng c\u1EA1nh ch\u1ED7 h\xEDt \u0111\u1EA5t
      \u1EDF khu t\u1EADp v\xE0 nh\u1EA5n F \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EA3i."
  - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a0b7e29ec3c82414a9790762da7c2656, type: 2}
    price: 20
    description: "Mua 1 ho\u1EB7c nhi\u1EC1u v\xE9 (ch\u1ECDn s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      \u1EDF tr\xEAn). Mang \u0111\u1EBFn MrBeast \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i th\u01B0\u1EDFng:
      \u0111o\xE1n \u0111\xFAng ch\u1EB5n/l\u1EBB th\xEC tr\xFAng 500 VN\u0110 m\u1ED7i
      v\xE9."
  - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9b836e60ff860a46adf8c1b6a83bef6, type: 2}
    price: 50
    description: "N\xF3n l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED9i l\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u cho g\xE0. Mua
      xong g\xE0 \u0111\u1ED9i ngay, kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n mang theo."
  - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4dfa4161ae174f448b392856639f690c, type: 2}
    price: 200
    description: "Ba thanh ki\u1EBFm c\u1EE7a Zoro \u0111eo sau l\u01B0ng g\xE0.
